      "writtenOn": "2022-10-07T11:09:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What do you mean by `libvm_payload_rs becomes \"a part\" of the payload`? I think the goal of this lib is to provide a shared library that payloads can link against. Do you mean we should define a `rust_library_dylib` to make it a shared lib explicitly?",
