      "writtenOn": "2022-10-07T11:26:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see. Thanks for the explanation!\n\nThe current libvm_payload is not a shared lib yet. There\u0027s a bug with `rust_ffi_shared` (b/250854486) for some builds. I\u0027ve been checking for a few days but haven\u0027t found a solution yet. In that sense, should we rewrite this library in C to make it shared first, then access it from Rust via bindgen?\n\nIt\u0027s easier to rewrite now as the package is still small.",
      "parentUuid": "b6b51460_b27874e2",
